WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:06.090
Assistant Researcher King selected an Isekai manga&nbsp;
titled: "Life in a fantasy world - what should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:11.370
I do?" and placed it into the Clockworks on the&nbsp;
setting "Very Fine." This was the output produced:

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.810
A manga titled: "Life in a fantasy world~&nbsp;
the spirits are controlling everyone!"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:24.090
about the life of SCP-914 and the researchers,&nbsp;
detailing tests 090X through 095X and providing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:28.890
the background to each of the tests. The manga&nbsp;
talks about how each researcher is controlled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:34.110
by a “spirit” and some researchers are said to&nbsp;
share a “spirit”. It is heavily implied that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:40.470
these “spirits” who decide what the input of the&nbsp;
tests are, and to an extent, what the output is.

